        "notes": "Now this is where the magic happens. Since [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) procs on every instance of weapon damage, soldier's full auto rifle will ramp up to max stacks in just 5 shots (about half a second) and stay there so long as you hit 1 in 3 bullets. That's basically a clean 25% AP and 10% WP in one item. Pick up [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) if you couldn't afford it last round, and combined with [Biotic Bullseye](item_94d800c1-0c78-4adb-bb06-87118d9a7b54) you should have near 100% biotic field uptime (only 3 seconds of downtime if you get a full 5 second extension from headshots). Try to keep [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) if possible for this round to maintain good WP numbers, but it's not a huge issue if you have to sell.",
