        "created_at": "2025-07-07T21:22:56.86673+00:00",
        "notes": "There's a lot of flexibility with how you can top off this build in the final round. I usually swap [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) to put some more pressure on the tanks and up my HP a bit, but as for the rest I'm still trying things out to see what I like best. Here's some ideas I came up with:\n\n- Grab [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) (or [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) if you're really rolling in cash) and pair it with [Back Off](item_cf806fa3-c276-4898-a092-7d7f1a908821) or [Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) to take advantage of your high AP.\n- Pick up [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) again, and paired with [Hunker Down](item_bfe7eeda-26d6-464a-9478-6c4a388d1577) you can keep a biotic field on you at all times without even trying. \n- Take [Man on the Run](item_26b054fc-d1f6-4361-8365-c632efe11582) to double your ammo pool and pair it with [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) to push pulse rifle's damage even further with increased fire rate and more bullets to chew through. [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) and [Biotic Bullseye](item_94d800c1-0c78-4adb-bb06-87118d9a7b54) will scale their ammo recovery off of the increased mag size.",
